Output docs/assets/gifs/tui-feature.gif
Set Shell bash
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set FontSize 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 15
Env NXY_ICONS "unicode"

Hide
Type "export PATH=/vhs/docs/assets/.build:$PATH; clear" Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show

Type "nxy tui --demo" Enter
Sleep 2s
Enter
Sleep 2500ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Type "a"
Sleep 2500ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 2s
Escape
Sleep 1s
